---
---
<section id="automation" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-950 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Accent lighting -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-sky-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400 font-bold mb-2">Engineering Technology</h2>
      <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">BIM &amp; AEC Automation</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Bridging structural engineering workflows with software development. Custom tools built to optimize modeling precision, automate sheet drafting, and streamline cloud-coordinated projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1: Dynamo -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 hover:border-sky-500/50 hover:bg-slate-900/90 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-sky-500/20 transition-all">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Dynamo Scripts for Revit</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Visual algorithms and computational geometry workflows to automate model auditing, QA validation, parameter propagation, and automated drawing sheet generation inside Autodesk Revit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-xs">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-sky-300 font-mono">Revit Dynamo</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-mono">Python Nodes</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-mono">Model QA</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: ACC / Forge -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 hover:border-sky-500/50 hover:bg-slate-900/90 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-all">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">ACC Automation (formerly Forge)</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Custom Python scripts and cloud pipelines leveraging Autodesk Construction Cloud (ACC) REST APIs for automated file migrations, cloud model synchronization, data pipelines, and metadata verification.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-xs">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-sky-300 font-mono">Autodesk Forge / ACC</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-mono">Python REST</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-mono">Data Extraction</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Revit Add-ins (C# & pyRevit) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 hover:border-sky-500/50 hover:bg-slate-900/90 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-indigo-500/20 transition-all">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Revit Add-ins (C# &amp; pyRevit)</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Production-grade Revit add-ins built with <strong>C# (.NET / Revit API)</strong> and <strong>pyRevit</strong>. Custom ribbon panels, automated wall adjustment algorithms, and batch detail importers used in live engineering workflows.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-xs">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-sky-300 font-mono">C# (.NET)</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-sky-300 font-mono">pyRevit</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-mono">Revit API</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
